extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SfOhunoX8eAQ7kNvwFR73N-&_nc_oc=Adon8nvNhJVPEBb8ng7694MhWtNAWxzU3XX2R6yFp1hNG4pMJ36Di1nZ7E92rPwryK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP6H1GEWrML98sluhNHQKPqqSnMWLtHygDKN175vwHHew&oe=6AD39256"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0To3dAHbmOkQ7kNvwEnN1I1&_nc_oc=Adq45KTo9jv6OsbEyP_e6gSu3xd6kz8Mnxc36sFMwnCMWOyOiSqXEO80gMEQ6M-kFFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM6uqDYfs_o0RUwS6sURqytJ9CvkjLhzp_qz1bJSqXoFw&oe=6AD399A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YNNk6ip3lG0Q7kNvwGXJ12s&_nc_oc=AdoklWJIjLbmG-1mUtMOlzObaA0Wn63FsDrJRPqdhs-m82grx4CBPWVOjmALt2Gv3AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN4YSXwfav6TqSxlCQITHoR_bhILHVHJyhNb0vhs32sFQ&oe=6AD3A199"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":